(taoryx-3dof-target-intercept)
*title Deterministic point-mass target intercept through the standard runner
*atmos none
*earth spherical gm=0 omega=0

*trajectory 1 interceptor start on 1
  *initial ecfc x=0 y=0 z=0 xdt=100 ydt=0 zdt=0 time=0 mass=100
  *file interceptor.dat time xecfc yecfc zecfc relrng[2] relvel[2] vel
  *segment 1 terminal-guidance
    *integ dtprnt=0.1 dt=0.01 dtguid=1
    *inertial ecfc
    *fly propnav=2
    *when relrng[2]<2 stop
    *when time>20 stop

*trajectory 2 target start on 1
  *initial ecfc x=1000 y=0 z=0 xdt=0 ydt=0 zdt=0 time=0 mass=1
  *file target.dat time xecfc yecfc zecfc
  *segment 1 stationary-target
    *integ dtprnt=0.1 dt=0.01
    *when time>20 stop
*end
